{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend. Build. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your own spacecraft in this fast-paced top-down shooter and become the guardian of Enfora Star, a remote space station under relentless attack by rogue AI robots. Your mission is clear: protect the station while mastering the art of space combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ship combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate your vessel around the space station, engaging hostile machines with precision and skill. Maneuver through enemy formations and weapon fire as you defend Enfora Star from multiple angles of attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform the battleground by constructing tactical defenses. Deploy walls to create choke points, install automated turrets for additional firepower, and design a defensive network that complements your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enfora Star blends arcade shooting action with strategic base building in a distinctive pixel art universe. Each defense mission challenges you to improve both your piloting skills and your tactical planning. How long can you keep Enfora Star operational against the mechanical threat?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552750?t=1751306472","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552750?t=1751306472","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/23af278a3336aa136bb72988723694d3b83257ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751306472","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/23af278a3336aa136bb72988723694d3b83257ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751306472","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend. Build. Survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of your own spacecraft in this fast-paced top-down shooter and become the guardian of Enfora Star, a remote space station under relentless attack by rogue AI robots. Your mission is clear: protect the station while mastering the art of space combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ship combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate your vessel around the space station, engaging hostile machines with precision and skill. Maneuver through enemy formations and weapon fire as you defend Enfora Star from multiple angles of attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic defense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform the battleground by constructing tactical defenses. Deploy walls to create choke points, install automated turrets for additional firepower, and design a defensive network that complements your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enfora Star blends arcade shooting action with strategic base building in a distinctive pixel art universe. Each defense mission challenges you to improve both your piloting skills and your tactical planning. How long can you keep Enfora Star operational against the mechanical threat?</p>","developers":["Haapa Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552750/20ba879ff8aae8feb639ad5743195c7feef4ddf8/header.jpg?t=1751306472","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114474,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steams